    122          *  MakeCrc16() : make to cyclic redendancy check 16 
    123          * *ptr로 지정된 번지부터 n byte 의 CRC를 계산해 16bit CRC를 리턴
    124          ********************************************************************/

   \                                 In segment CODE, align 4, keep-with-next
    125          unsigned short	MakeCrc16(unsigned char	*ptr, unsigned short	n)
    126          {
   \                     MakeCrc16:
